{
 "title": "The Guard Who Saluted Four Cars",
 "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
 "tempo": 1.14,
 "keepGap": 0.28,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Your colony guard has seen something you never noticed in three years.",
   "rate": "+20%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.2,
   "volume": "+10%"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every morning, Ramesh salutes the same four neighbours. Separately.",
   "rate": "+28%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight oh one, Rohan. Salute.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight oh two, Priya. Salute.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+4Hz",
   "gap": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight oh three, Arjun. Salute.",
   "rate": "+28%",
   "pitch": "+6Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight forty, Sharma ji. The arm just stays up now.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.22
  },
  {
   "text": "Three years. Same four cars. Same four salutes.",
   "rate": "+12%",
   "pitch": "-8Hz",
   "gap": 0.25,
   "volume": "+10%"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then one day, his arm just quits.",
   "rate": "+20%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "gap": 0.22
  },
  {
   "text": "So Ramesh finally reads their parking stickers.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "All four cars. Same tech park.",
   "rate": "+16%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Same building.",
   "rate": "+12%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "gap": 0.22,
   "volume": "+12%"
  },
  {
   "text": "So he walks up to them, bro, just go together.",
   "rate": "+22%",
   "pitch": "+8Hz",
   "gap": 0.2,
   "volume": "+10%"
  },
  {
   "text": "So they made a carpool group.",
   "rate": "+30%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty seven messages later, nobody knew who was driving, and Sharma ji was still two minutes away.",
   "rate": "+36%",
   "pitch": "+4Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Group, dead. Four cars. Four salutes.",
   "rate": "+14%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "gap": 0.25,
   "volume": "+10%"
  },
  {
   "text": "Turns out, the hard part of carpooling isn't the driving.",
   "rate": "+20%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "It's the deciding.",
   "rate": "+10%",
   "pitch": "-7Hz",
   "gap": 0.22,
   "volume": "+10%"
  },
  {
   "text": "So they let an app do the deciding.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "A roster picks who drives today. One tap says you're ready. And everyone watches the car arrive. Live.",
   "rate": "+32%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Now it's one car, four friends, and one salute.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Ramesh's arm has never been happier.",
   "rate": "+16%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.22
  },
  {
   "text": "Sharma ji is still late though. But now, everyone can see exactly where.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "If your colony guard deserves a break, the app's called Sahyatri.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Check it out. Link in bio.",
   "rate": "+18%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.3,
   "volume": "+10%"
  }
 ],
